<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Combined Corpse</title>
    <link href="style.css" rel="stylesheet" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Give+You+Glory&family=Inconsolata:wght@300&family=Tsukimi+Rounded&family=Yomogi&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
  </head>
  <body>
    <div id="context">
      <h1>Exquisite Corpse</h1>
      <h2>Background</h2>
      <p id="text">
        Exquisite Corpse is a collaborative drawing and writing game that was
        originally developed by Surrealist artists in the early 20th century,
        most notably André Breton and Yves Tanguy. The game is designed to be a
        creative, spontaneous, and often humorous way for multiple participants
        to collectively create an artwork or piece of writing.
        <br />
        <br />
        The name "exquisite corpse" is said to have originated from the first
        phrase created in the game, which was "The exquisite corpse shall drink
        the new wine." This phrase was created by the Surrealist poets during
        one of their early sessions of the game.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!--   <p>I should be able to change this so the output and input are the same page if we want. for now, i'm just confirming i can get the code to work  </p>
       -->
    <div id="spacer"></div>

    <div id="finalResult">
      <h1>Select a section to Draw</h1>
      <h2>You are drawing: <span id="cName"> </span></h2>

      <div id="final1"></div>
      <div id="final2"></div>
      <div id="final3"></div>

      <!--     saving all the drawing together -->

      <!--     <button id= "saveCompleted">Save</button><br/> -->
      <!--     
    <div id= "haha">
      You can't have this drawing because it's too precious!
    </div>
     -->

      <p id="instruction">
        Instructions:
        <br />
        1. type in your first name in the diologue box. If you don't see it,
        refresh the page.
        <br />2. select a section from the choices below. 
      </p>
      <button id="resetCorpse">Leave/Reset Corpse</button>
      <br />
      <a href="/drawingSection" target="_blank">Go to Drawing Section</a> <br />
    </div>

    <div class="canvas" id="canvas1">
      <img
        src="https://cdn.glitch.global/b894e5db-d703-4bfa-8621-f12497d2e4d3/Section1_temp.png"
        width="500"
      />
      <button class="button" id="section-1">Click for Section 1</button>
    </div>
    <div class="canvas" id="canvas2">
      <img
        src="https://cdn.glitch.global/b894e5db-d703-4bfa-8621-f12497d2e4d3/Section2_temp.png"
        width="500"
      />
      <button class="button" id="section-2">Click for Section 2</button>
    </div>
    <div class="canvas" id="canvas3">
      <img
        src="https://cdn.glitch.global/b894e5db-d703-4bfa-8621-f12497d2e4d3/Section3_temp.png"
        width="500"
      />
      <button class="button" id="section-3">Click for Section 3</button>
    </div>

    <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/p5.js/1.1.9/p5.js"></script>

    <script type="text/javascript" src="/socket.io/socket.io.js"></script>
    <script src="app.js"></script>
  </body>
</html>
